@WebApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5125

GET {{WebApi_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

###

GET {{WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/students
Accept: application/json

###
GET {{WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/students/{{studentId}}
Accept: application/json

